.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102617#issuecomment-2646834328","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102617","id":2646834328,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dw3yY","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T03:23:15Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T06:29:22Z","body":"@SeppNel You need to enable MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission during Export and request it using `OS.request_permissions()`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2646834328/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647213812","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102617#issuecomment-2647213812","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102617","id":2647213812,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dyUb0","user":{"login":"SeppNel","id":35899928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODk5OTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35899928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel","html_url":"https://github.com/SeppNel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T08:07:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T08:07:14Z","body":"> You need to enable MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission during Export and request it using OS.request_permissions()\n\nThis does work but I shouldn't need this level of permission. It forces users to trust a sketchy app from a sketchy developer (me) to not access all its files.\n\nThere are plenty of apps that do this without having the MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission. Which if I'm correct it is supposed to be used only for file managers and similar.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647213812/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647265006","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102617#issuecomment-2647265006","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102617","id":2647265006,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dyg7u","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T08:32:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T08:50:57Z","body":"> > You need to enable MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission during Export and request it using OS.request_permissions()\n> \n> This does work but I shouldn't need this level of permission. It forces users to trust a sketchy app from a sketchy developer (me) to not access all its files.\n> \n> There are plenty of apps that do this without having the MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission. Which if I'm correct it is supposed to be used only for file managers and similar.\n\nYes, I agree that this is a very broad permission and should only be used if absolutely necessary.\n\nCurrently on Android, saving files to external storage (except for the `Documents` directory) requires the `MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE` permission. However, even saving to the `Documents` directory, you must write to path directly using `FileAccess` without using native file picker.\n\nYou also need the MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission to read _data_ files from external storage (except for the Documents directory). For media files, there are general permissions like READ_MEDIA_IMAGES, which can be used instead.\n\nWe are working to fix these limitations 🙂\n\nClosing this as completed. Please feel free to comment if you have further questions.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647265006/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647347986","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102617#issuecomment-2647347986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102617","id":2647347986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dy1MS","user":{"login":"SeppNel","id":35899928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODk5OTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35899928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel","html_url":"https://github.com/SeppNel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T09:02:25Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T09:02:25Z","body":"Writing directly to the Documents directory is an acceptable solution. I just tested it and it works fine. Thank you for the quick answer.\n\nI'm having some problems for reading the file. When reding the one I created it works, but if i modify the file it gives me File not found.\n\n```\nfunc test_read():\n\tvar file = FileAccess.open(OS.get_system_dir(OS.SYSTEM_DIR_DOCUMENTS) + \"/export.json\", FileAccess.READ)\n\tif file:\n\t\tprint(file.get_as_text())\n\t\tfile.close()\n\telse:\n\t\tprint(error_string(FileAccess.get_open_error())) \n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647347986/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647367122","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102617#issuecomment-2647367122","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102617","id":2647367122,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dy53S","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T09:09:27Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T09:09:27Z","body":">  but if i modify the file it gives me File not found.\n\nCould you please explain, what you mean by this?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647367122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647374053","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102617#issuecomment-2647374053","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102617","id":2647374053,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dy7jl","user":{"login":"SeppNel","id":35899928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODk5OTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35899928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel","html_url":"https://github.com/SeppNel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T09:12:20Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T09:17:00Z","body":"If I replace the file or open it with a text editor and change the text inside, I'm no longer able to read it. The error code that FileAccess.get_open_error() returns is \"File not found\"\n\n[MRP](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18731126/androidexternalstorage.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647374053/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647409126","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102617#issuecomment-2647409126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102617","id":2647409126,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dzEHm","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T09:26:05Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T09:29:06Z","body":"> If I replace the file or open it with a text editor and change the text inside, I'm no longer able to read it, the error code that FileAccess.get_open_error() returns is \"File not found\"\n\nUnfortunately, this is a limitation imposed by the Android OS. You can only access files created by your app, once they are modified by another app, you lose access to them. \n\nTo properly address external storage file handling issues, we would probably need to make core changes. However, this could break compatibility with previous versions and introduce challenges for cross-platform development, as other platforms use file paths while Android now prefers content URIs now. \nI'm trying to find a better solution that would help to avoid these issues like, breaking compatibility.\n\nFor now, I recommend keeping a copy of the file in `\"user://\"` and saving changes to the `Documents` directory when its updated. Basically, prevent users from making external modifications.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647409126/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647416968","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102617#issuecomment-2647416968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102617","id":2647416968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dzGCI","user":{"login":"SeppNel","id":35899928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODk5OTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35899928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel","html_url":"https://github.com/SeppNel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeppNel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https